# Allowlist: only what the bot image build needs. Secrets, local config, data, tests,
# docs and the sandbox tree never enter the build context, except the music-synth skill text,
# which the bot injects into prompts (one source: the same file the sandbox Codex reads).
# README.md is required: pyproject.toml declares it as the package readme (hatchling build).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src
!sandbox/skills/music-synth/SKILL.md

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.bak*
secrets*
config.toml
.env
.env.*
